  "id": "section-987",
  "title": "关于党组织的指示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-367.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>367)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　党组织应是无产阶级先进分子所组成，应能领导无产阶级和革命群众对于阶级敌人进行战斗的朝气蓬勃的先锋队组织。<br>\n<br>\n<p>　　（转摘自《人民日报》、《红旗》、杂志、《解放军报》一九六八年元旦社论：《迎接无产阶级文化大革命的全面胜利》）</p>\n<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-366.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-368.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
